uilt than other Snowchildren, they have become even more hyperactive due to the mysterious substance that landed on Karlan. Most have completed the achievement of going all the way around Kjerag.","abilities":["Takes extra damage on colliding with high ground"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.6,"stats":{"hp":7000,"atk":300,"def":200,"res":10,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":5}},"frostcradler_fowlbeast":{"slug":"frostcradler_fowlbeast","name":"Frostcradler Fowlbeast","icon":"/enemies-icons/Frostcradler Fowlbeast.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Fowlbeasts indigenous to Kjerag. The influence of the mysterious substance that landed on Karlan has strengthened their vision and sense of smell, but also made them more aggressive. They clutch an icy rock formed from an unhatched egg, which they use to dig for food and crack the skulls of enemies.","abilities":["Loses egg after being shifted, gaining Movement Speed and becoming unblockable"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":10000,"atk":400,"def":200,"res":20,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":3.5}},"penumbral_snowball":{"slug":"penumbral_snowball","name":"Penumbral Snowball","icon":"/enemies-icons/Penumbral Snowball.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Creatures indigenous to Kjerag. The influence of the mysterious substance that landed on Karlan seems to have changed their friendly nature, and made their fur even softer and fluffier, providing excellent protection against the cold.","abilities":["Absorbs passing Snowbrats to increase its weight, HP, ATK, DEF, and RES","Returns to initial form on colliding with high ground"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"